\v 17 Then¦316341 \add ≈some\add* of¦316348 \add Yehudah's\add* elders¦316343 \add ≈stepped forward\add* and¦316341 spoke¦316345 to¦316346 all¦316348 the¦316350 people¦316351 who were gathered¦316350 there,
\v 18 “Micah (\add Heb. Mikah,\add* the¦316356 Morashtite¦316356) prophesied¦316358 \add ≈during¦316359 the¦316359 lifetime¦316359\add* of¦316382 Yehudah's¦316363 King¦316361 Hizkiyah¦316360\add !(Hezekiah)\add*, and¦316364 he¦316364 told¦316364 all¦316367 the people¦316369 from Yehudah¦316370 that Commander-in-chief Yahweh¦316376 says¦316374 this:
