\q1 and¦316381 Yerushalem¦316381 will become heaps¦316382 \add of ruins\add*,
\q1 and the¦316369 \add ≈temple¦316385\add* hill¦316384 will become an \add ≈overgrown\add* forest¦316387.\x + \xo 26:18: \xt Mic 3:12.\x*
\m
\v 19 Did¦316390 Yehudah's¦316394 King¦316392 Hizkiyah¦316391 or anyone else in Yehudah¦316397 put¦316390 him¦316390 to¦316390 death¦316390? Didn't \add @Hizkiyah¦316399\add* \add ≈respect¦316399 and honour\add* Yahweh and \add ≈ask for\add* \add *his\add* favour, and didn't¦316398 Yahweh \add ≈relent from sending\add* the¦316412 disaster¦316412 that he¦316415 had¦316415 pronounced¦316415 against them¦316416? \add ≈It¦316408 seems that\add* we're¦316417 about¦316418 to¦316418 bring great¦316420 \add ≈harm\add* on¦316421 ourselves.”
