\p
\v 1 At the beginning¦316532 of¦316533 the¦316533 reign¦316533 of Yehudah's¦316539 King¦316538 Yehoyakim¦316534 (\add Jehoiakim\add*, son¦316535 of¦316535 Yoshiyah¦316537 \add Josiah\add*), this¦316542 message¦316541 came¦316540 to¦316543 Yirmeyah¦316545 \add !(Jeremiah¦316545)\add* from¦316546 Yahweh¦316547,\x + \xo 27:1: \xt 2Ki 24:18-20; 2Ch 36:11-13.\x*
\v 2 telling¦316552 \add %him\add* this:
\m Make¦316553 yourself¦316556 a wooden \add ox\add* yoke with bars, and¦316558 \add ≈tie\add* it to¦316554 your¦316562 neck¦316562.
\v 3 \add ≈Use it to send¦316564 messages\add* to¦316565 the¦316567 kings¦316567 of¦316571 Edom¦316568, Moab¦316572, Ammon¦316577, Tsor¦316581 \add !(Tyre¦316581)\add*, and¦316564 Tsidon¦316585 \add !(Sidon¦316585)\add*, \add ≈through¦316586 the¦316586 ambassadors¦316587\add* \add from those countries\add* who've come¦316588 to Yerushalem¦316589 to \add meet with\add* King¦316567 Tsidkiyah¦316592 \add !(Zedekiah¦316592)\add*
\v 4 to tell¦316604 them¦316597 that Yisrael's¦316608 god¦316607, Commander-in-chief Yahweh¦316605 says¦316604 to give their¦316600 masters¦316600 this message:
\v 5 I myself made¦316616 the¦316619 earth¦316619 \add and\add* the¦316622 \add #people¦316622\add* and¦316623 \add #animals\add* that¦316626 are¦316627 on¦316627 the earth¦316630, by¦316631 my \add ≈direct actions\add* and my great¦316632 strength¦316631, and I give¦316635 it¦316635 to¦316636 whoever I \add ≈see fit\add*.
\v 6 Now¦316640 I've \add ≈personally handed¦316649 over\add* all¦316645 these¦316648 lands¦316647 to my¦316654 servant¦316654, the Babylonian King¦316651 Nebuchadnezzar¦316650, and¦316640 I've also¦316655 given the¦316658 animals¦316658 in¦316649 the countryside¦316659 to¦316661 him¦316661 to¦316662 serve¦316662 him¦316662.
\v 7 All¦316666 the¦316668 nations¦316668 will serve him and¦316669 his¦316671 son¦316671 and¦316672 then his¦316676 \add ≈grandson\add*, until¦316677 the¦316680 time¦316680 of¦316680 his¦316681 own land¦316681 comes¦316678 \add due\add*. \add ≈Yes, it¦316665 will\add*, and then many¦316666 nations¦316687 and¦316689 great¦316690 kings¦316689 will make him serve them.
\p
\v 8 Any nation¦316693 or kingdom¦316694 that¦316695 won't serve¦316698 the¦316703 Babylonian King Nebuchadnezzar¦316702 and¦316706 that¦316707 won't put¦316710 its¦316713 neck¦316713 into his¦316732 yoke¦316714, then¦316692 I'll¦316720 punish that nation with¦316717 \add ≈war\add* and¦316718 famine¦316718 and¦316719 \add ≈disease\add* until¦316728 I've¦316730 used \add @King Nebuchadnezzar\add* to finish them¦316731 \add off\add*. That¦316724 is¦316692 Yahweh's¦316727 declaration¦316725,
\v 9 \add ≈so\add* don't¦316735 you all keep listening¦316737 to¦316738 your ‘prophets¦316740’, and¦316741 to¦316741 your diviners¦316743 and¦316744 dreamers¦316745, and¦316746 to¦316746 your soothsayers¦316748 and¦316749 sorcerers¦316751—all those who¦316752 keep telling¦316755 you that¦316752 you all won't¦316735 serve¦316759 the¦316762 Babylonian¦316763 king¦316762,
\v 10 because¦316765 they're¦316767 prophesying¦316768 lies to¦316769 you, so¦316770 as¦316770 to¦316771 remove¦316771 you all far¦316771 away¦316771 from¦316773 on your land¦316774. \add ≈Yes,\add* I¦316775 will¦316775 drive¦316775 you all out¦316775 and¦316777 you'll die¦316777 \add in a foreign land\add*.
\v 11 \add ≈However,\add* the¦316779 nation¦316779 that¦316780 brings¦316781 its neck¦316784 into¦316785 the Babylonian king's¦316786 yoke¦316785 and¦316789 serves¦316789 him¦316789, I'll¦316790 let¦316790 \add @that¦316790 nation¦316790\add* remain¦316790 on¦316791 its land¦316793, and¦316797 it¦316798 will¦316798 cultivate¦316797 it¦316797 and¦316798 live¦316798 \add ≈there\add*. That's is Yahweh's¦316796 declaration¦316794.
\p
\v 12 Then¦316801 to¦316801 Yehudah's¦316806 King¦316804 Tsidkiyah¦316803 \add !(Zedekiah¦316803)\add*, I¦316807 \add ≈passed on\add* those¦316811 \add same\add* words¦316810, saying¦316812, “Put your necks¦316816 into¦316817 the¦316817 yoke¦316817 of¦316804 the Babylonian king¦316818, and¦316821 serve¦316821 him¦316822 and¦316823 his¦316823 people¦316823, and¦316824 live¦316824.
\v 13 Why would you¦316828 and¦316829 your¦316829 people¦316829 die¦316827 from \add ≈war\add*, famine¦316831, and¦316832 \add ≈disease\add*, as¦316833 Yahweh¦316835 has¦316834 \add ≈said¦316834 will¦316827 come to¦316836 any\add* nation¦316838 that¦316839 doesn't serve¦316842 the¦316838 Babylonian king¦316845?
\v 14 \add ≈So¦316848\add* don't¦316848 listen¦316850 to¦316851 the¦316853 messages¦316853 from the¦316854 prophets¦316854 who¦316855 are¦316855 speaking¦316855 to you when they¦316866 tell¦316855 you all not¦316858 to serve¦316859 the¦316862 king¦316862 of¦316862 Babylon¦316863 as they're¦316866 prophesying¦316867 lies to¦316868 you
\v 15 because¦316870 I¦316872 didn't¦316871 send¦316872 them¦316872. Yahweh¦316875 declares¦316873 that they're¦316876 using my¦316878 name¦316878 to prophesy¦316877 lies¦316879 so¦316880 that I'll drive¦316881 you out¦316881, and¦316883 you'll all perish¦316883—\add both\add* you and¦316885 the¦316885 prophets¦316885 who¦316886 are¦316886 prophesying¦316886 to¦316887 you.”
\v 16 Then¦316889 I¦316898 told¦316898 the priests¦316891 and¦316892 all¦316894 those people¦316896 that Yahweh¦316917 says¦316901: Don't¦316903 listen¦316905 to¦316906 the¦316908 words¦316908 of¦316908 your prophets¦316909 who¦316910 are¦316910 prophesying to you and saying¦316898 that the¦316914 utensils¦316914 from Yahweh's¦316902 \add ≈temple¦316915\add* will¦316910 \add ≈soon\add* be¦316918 brought¦316918 back¦316918 from¦316919 Babylon¦316919, because¦316922 they're¦316924 prophesying¦316925 lies to¦316926 you.
\v 17 Don't¦316928 listen¦316930 to¦316931 them¦316931. Serve¦316932 the¦316935 Babylonian king¦316935 and¦316938 live¦316938. Why should this¦316942 city¦316941 become¦316940 a ruin¦316943?
