\v 21 Yisrael's¦317032 god¦317031, Commander-in-chief Yahweh¦317038 says¦317028 about¦317031 the¦317035 utensils¦317035 remaining¦317036 in Yahweh's¦317029 \add ≈temple\add* and¦317039 in the¦317039 \add ≈palace\add* of¦317039 the¦317040 king¦317040 of¦317040 Yehudah¦317042 and¦317043 Yerushalem¦317043:
