\v 12 ⇔After the prophet Hananyah¦317330 broke¦317329 the yoke bar that had been¦317321 on the prophet Yirmeyah's¦317327 neck¦317336, Yahweh's¦317324 message¦317322 came to¦317325 Yirmeyah¦317337 saying¦317339,
\v 13 “Go¦317341 and¦317342 tell¦317348 Hananyah¦317345 this: ‘Yahweh¦317349 says¦317348 that you've¦317352 broken¦317352 wooden¦317351 yoke bars, but¦317342 in¦317354 their¦317354 place¦317354, you'll¦317342 make¦317353 yoke bars out of¦317350 iron¦317356,’
