\v 15 Then¦317393 the prophet Yirmeyah¦317394 told¦317393 the prophet Hananyah, “Listen¦317400, please¦317402, Hananyah. Yahweh¦317407 hasn't sent¦317406 you, and¦317393 you yourself have¦317409 made¦317409 this¦317413 people¦317412 \add group\add* \add ≈put their trust¦317409 in things that¦317413 aren't¦317404 true\add*.
\v 16 Because¦317430 of¦317423 that, Yahweh says¦317420 this: ‘Listen, I'm¦317422 \add ≈removing you¦317423 from¦317424 this¦317427 world\add*. \add ≈You'll die¦317429 this very\add* year¦317427, because¦317430 you¦317433 have¦317433 \add ≈said¦317420 things that would¦317429 cause the¦317425 people to¦317423 rebel¦317432\add* against¦317434 Yahweh.’ ”
