\p
\v 1 The¦317448 prophet¦317453 Yirmeyah¦317452 sent¦317451 a \add ≈letter¦317449\add* from¦317454 Yerushalem to¦317455 the¦317457 remainder¦317457 of¦317457 the¦317458 elders¦317458 of¦317458 the exile¦317472, and to the priests¦317462, and¦317463 to¦317463 the¦317465 prophets¦317465, and¦317466 to¦317466 all¦317468 the¦317470 people¦317470 that¦317450 Nebuchadnezzar¦317473 had¦317472 exiled¦317472 from¦317474 Yerushalem to¦317475 Babylon¦317475\x + \xo 29:1-2: \xt 2Ki 24:12-16; 2Ch 36:10.\x*
\v 2 after¦317477 the \add ≈removal\add* from¦317489 Yerushalem of King¦317481 Yekonyah \add !(Jeconiah¦317479)\add* and¦317482 the¦317482 queen¦317482 mother, the¦317483 \add ≈court¦317483 officials¦317484\add* and the leaders¦317484 of¦317484 Yehudah¦317485 and Yerushalem, plus¦317482 the craftsmen¦317487 and¦317488 the¦317488 metalsmiths.
\v 3 \add He sent it\add* with Shafan's¦317495 son Elasah¦317492 and¦317496 Hilkiyah's¦317499 son Gemaryah¦317496, who¦317500 Yehudah's¦317505 King Tsidkiyah¦317502 \add !(Zedekiah¦317502)\add* sent¦317501 to¦317506 the¦317509 Babylonian King Nebuchadnezzar¦317508 in Babylon¦317510. \add The letter\add* said¦317512,
\pi1
\v 4 Yisrael's¦317520 god¦317519, Commander-in-chief Yahweh¦317517 says¦317516 this to¦317521 all¦317521 \add ≈of¦317519 you\add* that I've¦317526 exiled¦317523 from¦317527 Yerushalem¦317527 to¦317528 Babylon¦317528:
\v 5 Build¦317530 houses¦317531 and¦317532 live¦317532 in them, and¦317533 plant¦317533 gardens¦317534 and¦317535 eat¦317535 their¦317538 fruit.
\v 6 \add ≈Marry\add* and \add ≈have children\add*. \add ≈Find\add* wives¦317547 for¦317546 your sons¦317546 and¦317548 give¦317551 your daughters¦317550 \add ≈in marriage\add* so¦317553 that¦317553 they¦317553 \add also\add* \add ≈have children\add*. \add ≈Increase¦317556 in number\add* there¦317558—don't¦317559 become fewer.
\v 7 \add ≈In¦317578 addition¦317563, the¦317566 city¦317567 that I've¦317569 sent¦317569 you all into¦317569 exile¦317569 to, work to make it more prosperous\add* and¦317563 pray¦317572 to¦317574 Yahweh¦317576 for¦317577 it, because¦317577 \add ≈if¦317577 it prospers, its¦317578 prosperity will¦317579 belong¦317579 to all of¦317566 you\add*.
\v 8 That's¦317596 because¦317584 Yisrael's¦317590 god¦317589, Commander-in-chief Yahweh¦317587 says¦317586 this: Don't¦317591 let¦317593 your prophets¦317595 and¦317599 diviners¦317599 who¦317596 are¦317598 among you deceive¦317593 you, and don't¦317591 listen¦317602 to¦317603 your dreams¦317605 that¦317606 you \add wishfully\add* dream¦317605,
\v 9 because¦317610 \add @those¦317617 prophets¦317613\add* are¦317613 prophesying¦317613 \add ≈using\add* my¦317615 name¦317615 \add ≈but not¦317616 being truthful\add*—I¦317617 didn't¦317616 send¦317617 them¦317617. That is Yahweh's¦317620 declaration¦317618.
