\v 2 Yahweh¦322997 says¦322996 this: Anyone¦322998 who¦322998 stays¦322998 in¦322999 this city¦322999 will¦323001 be killed by¦323002 \add ≈fighting\add*, famine¦323003, or \add ≈deadly diseases\add*, \add ≈but¦323004\add* anyone¦322998 who¦323005 goes¦323005 out¦323005 to¦323006 the¦323008 \add ≈Babylonians¦323008\add* will \add ≈survive¦323016—they won't be killed\add*.
