\v 22 Listen king of¦323493 Yehudah¦323501, all¦323493 the women¦323495 who¦323496 are¦323497 left¦323497 in¦323498 your¦323517 \add ≈palace¦323498\add* will be¦323502 taken¦323502 out¦323502 to¦323503 the Babylonian king's¦323506 commanders¦323505. Those women will¦323509 tell¦323509 you¦323510,
