\v 10 See, I'm living¦324326 in Mitspah¦324327 to meet with the \add ≈Babylonians\add* who¦324331 came¦324332 to¦324333 us¦324333. \add ≈So¦324324\add* harvest wine¦324336, summer¦324337 fruit¦324337, and¦324338 oil¦324338 and¦324339 store them¦324339 in¦324340 your containers. Live in¦324342 the cities¦324342 that¦324343 you've \add ≈occupied¦324345\add*.”
