\v 10 Next Yishmael¦324754 captured the remaining¦324772 people¦324760 in¦324762 Mitspah¦324762, \add ≈including¦324767\add* the king's¦324766 daughters¦324765 and¦324752 all¦324769 the¦324771 others who¦324774 the¦324777 chief¦324777 bodyguard¦324779 Nevuzar-Adan had¦324775 assigned¦324775 to Ahikam's¦324785 son Gedalyah¦324782. \add ≈So¦324752\add* Netanyah's¦324790 son Yishmael captured them¦324786 to¦324792 hand over¦324792 to¦324793 the¦324795 \add ≈Ammonites¦324796\add*.
