\v 11 \add ≈Meanwhile\add* Kareah's¦324803 son Yohanan¦324800 and¦324804 all¦324804 the army¦324807 commanders¦324806 with¦324809 him¦324809, heard¦324799 about¦324801 all¦324811 the¦324813 evil¦324813 \add >things¦324813\add* that¦324814 Netanyah's¦324819 son Yishmael¦324816 had¦324815 done¦324815,
