\v 7 After ten¦325145 days¦325146, Yahweh's¦325150 \add ≈response\add* came to¦325151 Yirmeyah¦325153,
\v 8 \add ≈so\add* \add *he¦325155\add* called¦325155 Kareah's¦325161 son¦325159 Yohanan¦325158 and¦325155 all¦325163 the army¦325166 commanders¦325165, as well as all¦325169 the¦325171 people¦325171 from¦325172 the¦325172 less \add ≈prominent\add* to¦325173 the¦325175 \add ≈most important officials\add*,
\v 9 then¦325177 he¦325177 told¦325177 them¦325178, “You all sent¦325186 me¦325187 to Yisrael's¦325184 god¦325183 Yahweh¦325182 \add ≈to pass on your requests\add* \add ≈and¦325177 here's his reply\add*:
\v 10 If¦325207 you all stay¦325196 in this¦325198 \add ≈region\add*, then I'll build¦325199 you up¦325199 and¦325201 not¦325201 tear¦325202 you¦325202 down¦325202. I'll plant¦325203 you and¦325205 not¦325205 pull¦325206 you¦325206 all out, because¦325207 I'm¦325208 upset about¦325209 the¦325211 harm¦325211 that¦325212 I've¦325213 done¦325213 to¦325214 you all.
\v 11 Don't be¦325218 afraid¦325218 of¦325219 the¦325220 Babylonian king¦325220 \add ≈any more\add*. This is Yahweh's¦325233 declaration¦325231: Don't be afraid of him¦325226 because¦325234 I'm with¦325236 you all to¦325238 save¦325238 you and¦325240 to¦325240 rescue¦325240 you from¦325242 his¦325226 \add ≈clutches\add*,
\v 12 because I'll give¦325244 you all mercy¦325247. I'll have¦325247 compassion¦325247 on¦325247 you, and¦325244 I'll restore¦325249 you all back to¦325251 your \add ≈country¦325253\add*.
