\v 13 \add ≈However,\add* suppose that¦325262 you all decide not¦325263 to¦325264 listen¦325264 to¦325265 the¦325265 \add ≈words\add* of¦325265 your god¦325267 Yahweh¦325266, and¦325255 \add ≈decide\add* not¦325259 to stay¦325260 in this¦325262 \add ≈region\add*,
