\p
\v 1 Yahweh spoke to¦325795 Yirmeyah¦325797 about¦325798 all¦325799 the¦325801 Judeans¦325801 who¦325802 lived in Migdol¦325806, Tahpanhes¦325807, and¦325807 Memphis¦325808 in \add northern/lower\add* Egypt¦325804, as well as those in Patros¦325810 \add in southern/upper Egypt\add*:
