\v 3 \add ≈That's¦325847 because¦325847\add* of¦325845 the wicked¦325846 things they¦325848 did¦325848 to¦325849 provoke¦325849 me¦325849 to¦325849 anger¦325849 by going¦325850 to¦325851 burn¦325851 incense¦325851 and¦325860 to worship¦325852 other¦325854 gods¦325853 that¦325847 neither they themselves, nor you, nor your ancestors¦325860 had¦325857 \add ≈ever heard about¦325845 before\add*.
\v 4 I repeatedly sent¦325862 all¦325866 my¦325868 servants¦325868, the¦325869 prophets¦325869, to them to tell¦325872 \add >the¦325872 people¦325872\add* to stop doing those detestable¦325880 things¦325878 that¦325882 I hate¦325883,
