\v 6 \add ≈So¦325900\add* my¦325901 anger¦325902 and rage¦325901 was poured¦325900 out¦325900 and burnt¦325903 in¦325904 Yehudah's¦325905 cities¦325904 and¦325906 Yerushalem's¦325907 streets¦325906 \add like a fire\add* and¦325908 they're \add still\add* desolate¦325910 ruins¦325909 to¦325910 this¦325912 day¦325911.
\p
\v 7 \add ≈So\add* now¦325915 Yisrael's¦325923 god¦325920, Commander-in-chief Yahweh¦325919 \add ≈asks¦325918\add* why¦325924 you all \add insist on\add* \add ≈bringing this terrible\add* harm¦325927 onto yourselves \add that'll see\add* men¦325934 and¦325936 women¦325936, children¦325937 and¦325938 babies from¦325939 Yehudah¦325940, eliminated without even leaving¦325942 a remnant¦325944.
\v 8 You've provoked¦325946 me¦325946 to¦325946 anger¦325946 by¦325947 \add ≈what you've all done\add* with your¦325948 \add own\add* two¦325948 hands¦325948, by¦325949 \add ≈burning incense¦325949\add* to¦325950 other¦325951 gods¦325950 in¦325952 Egypt¦325953 where¦325954 you've all gone to¦325958 \add ≈live¦325958 as¦325960 foreigners\add*. You've cut¦325961 yourselves off¦325961 so¦325963 as¦325963 to¦325964 become¦325964 a curse¦325965 \add word\add* and¦325966 a reproach¦325966 among¦325967 all¦325967 the¦325968 nations¦325968 in the¦325969 \add ≈world¦325969\add*.
