\v 10 To this¦326001 day¦326000, they¦326003 still \add ≈haven't humbled themselves\add*. They¦326006 don't respect¦326003 \add ≈the¦326000 instructions¦326007 or regulations¦326008 that¦326009 I¦326011 gave\add* them and¦326013 their ancestors¦326014, \add ≈and so they don't follow them\add*.
