\v 11 Therefore Yisrael's¦326024 god¦326023, Commander-in-chief says¦326020 this: Listen, I'm¦326025 about¦326026 \add ≈to start working against\add* you all to \add ≈bring disaster¦326029\add* and¦326030 \add ≈destroy\add* all¦326033 Yehudah¦326035.
