\v 1 This is the¦326551 message¦326551 that¦326552 the¦326555 prophet¦326555 Yirmeyah¦326554 \add !(Jeremiah¦326554)\add* dictated to¦326556 Neriyah's¦326561 son Baruk¦326558 to have it written¦326562 on¦326567 a scroll¦326569 in¦326572 the¦326573 fourth¦326573 year¦326572 of¦326574 \add of the reign\add* of¦326578 Yehudah's¦326579 King¦326578 Yehoyakim¦326574 (\add Jehoiakim\add*, son¦326575 of¦326575 Yoshiyah¦326577\add !/Josiah¦326577\add*):\x + \xo 45:1: \xt 2Ki 24:1; 2Ch 36:5-7; Dan 1:1-2.\x*
\v 2 Yisrael's¦326588 god¦326587 Yahweh¦326586 says¦326585 this to¦326589 you¦326589 Baruk¦326590:
