\v 4 Yahweh¦326618 says¦326617 to tell¦326614 \add @Baruk¦326617\add*, Listen, I'm¦326623 about¦326624 to¦326624 tear¦326624 down¦326624 what I've built¦326622 throughout the¦326635 \add ≈world¦326635\add*, and¦326625 to¦326630 pull¦326630 out what I've planted¦326628.
\v 5 \add ≈But¦326638 maybe\add* you're¦326639 hoping for¦326641 great¦326642 things for yourself¦326641? Don't¦326643 hope for that, because¦326646 listen, disaster¦326649 is coming¦326669 for all¦326665 humanity, but¦326638 wherever¦326668 you¦326669 go¦326669, I'm¦326647 giving¦326658 you your life¦326662 as your¦326662 ‘spoil¦326663 of¦326652 war’. That¦326658 is Yahweh's¦326657 declaration¦326655.
